65602f" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 600ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0"><b>不能。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="1">这是一个很常见的误解。你需要区分**“方法”<b>和</b>“接口”**（或“对象”）的区别：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b><code>registerBeanDefinition</code> 是一个 <i>方法</i>（Method）</b>：</p><ul data-path-to-node="2,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,1,0,0">它的作用是**“注册”<b>或</b>“写入”**。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,1,1,0">你调用它是为了<i>告诉</i> Spring 容器：“请帮我把这个新的 Bean 定义（<code>BeanDefinition</code>）<i>添加</i>到你的登记簿里。”</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,1,2,0">它是一个<b>写入操作</b>，不是一个读取操作。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code> 是一个 <i>接口</i>（Interface）</b>：</p><ul data-path-to-node="2,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,1,0,0">它代表的是**“登记簿”**本身。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,1,1,0">这个“登记簿”<b>既提供了“写入”的方法</b>（如 <code>registerBeanDefinition</code>），也<b>提供了“读取”的方法</b>。</p></li></ul></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="3"><p data-path-to-node="4"></p><h3>如何获取容器中所有的 BeanDefinition？</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="5">你需要使用的是 <code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code> 接口中的<b>其他方法</b>：</p><ul data-path-to-node="6"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,0"><b><code>String[] getBeanDefinitionNames()</code></b></p><ul data-path-to-node="6,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,1,0,0">这个方法用来获取容器中当前<b>所有</b>已注册的 <code>BeanDefinition</code> 的<b>名称</b>（即 <code>beanName</code>）的字符串数组。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,0"><b><code>BeanDefinition getBeanDefinition(String beanName)</code></b></p><ul data-path-to-node="6,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,1,0,0">根据指定的 <code>beanName</code>，获取其对应的 <code>BeanDefinition</code> 对象。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,2,0"><b><code>int getBeanDefinitionCount()</code></b></p><ul data-path-to-node="6,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,2,1,0,0">获取当前注册的 <code>BeanDefinition</code> 的总数。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,3,0"><b><code>boolean containsBeanDefinition(String beanName)</code></b></p><ul data-path-to-node="6,3,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,3,1,0,0">检查是否包含指定名称的 <code>BeanDefinition</code>。</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="7"></p><h3>示例：在 <code>ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar</code> 中使用</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="8">在你之前提到的 <code>ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar</code> 中，你可以这样做：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-271 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2179167942-271 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_479525c5b365602f&quot;,&quot;c_965ca52fee0e6f85&quot;,null,&quot;rc_7cf52579b582f202&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwj7hdrNx4WRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQlQM" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2179167942-271 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-271">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2179167942-271 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2179167942-271 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_479525c5b365602f&quot;,&quot;c_965ca52fee0e6f85&quot;,null,&quot;rc_7cf52579b582f202&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2179167942-271"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2179167942-271"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-271"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2179167942-271"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.beans.factory.config.BeanDefinition;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.beans.factory.support.BeanDefinitionRegistry;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.context.annotation.ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.core.type.AnnotationMetadata;

<span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">MyRegistrar</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">implements</span> <span class="hljs-title">ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar</span> </span>{

    <span class="hljs-meta">@Override</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">registerBeanDefinitions</span><span class="hljs-params">(AnnotationMetadata importingClassMetadata, 
                                        BeanDefinitionRegistry registry)</span> </span>{

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 获取所有已注册的 bean 名称</span>
        String[] allBeanNames = registry.getBeanDefinitionNames();

        System.out.println(<span class="hljs-string">"--- 容器中已注册的 BeanDefinition 总数: "</span> + registry.getBeanDefinitionCount() + <span class="hljs-string">" ---"</span>);

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 遍历并获取每一个 BeanDefinition</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (String beanName : allBeanNames) {
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 检查是不是我们关心的 bean</span>
            <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (beanName.equals(<span class="hljs-string">"someSpecificService"</span>)) {
                
                <span class="hljs-comment">// 3. 根据名称获取具体的 BeanDefinition</span>
                BeanDefinition beanDefinition = registry.getBeanDefinition(beanName);
                
                System.out.println(<span class="hljs-string">"找到了 'someSpecificService'，它的类是: "</span> + beanDefinition.getBeanClassName());
                
                <span class="hljs-comment">// 你甚至可以在这里修改它（虽然这更推荐在 BeanFactoryPostProcessor 中做）</span>
                <span class="hljs-comment">// beanDefinition.setLazyInit(true); </span>
            }
        }
        
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 4. 在这里，你仍然可以“写入”新的 BeanDefinition</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment">// RootBeanDefinition newBeanDef = new RootBeanDefinition(MyNewService.class);</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment">// registry.registerBeanDefinition("myNewService", newBeanDef);</span>
    }
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="10"></p><h3>总结</h3><p></p><ul data-path-to-node="11"><li><p data-path-to-node="11,0,0"><code>registerBeanDefinition(String name, BeanDefinition def)</code>：是**“登记”**（写入）操作。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,0"><code>getBeanDefinitionNames()</code> 和 <code>getBeanDefinition(String name)</code>：是**“查询”**（读取）操作。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,2,0">它们都是 <code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code>（登记簿）这个接口提供的能力。</p></li></ul></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" class="response-footer complete has-thoughts is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" _nghost-ng-c3711665544="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1330069915="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c1330069915-259"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3862268828="" class="ng-tns-c3862268828-264 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3862268828="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3862268828-264 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3862268828="" class="spacer ng-tns-c3862268828-264 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3862268828="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c3862268828-264"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3862268828="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c3862268828-264"><!----></mat-menu><!---->