e"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1330069915="" role="img" fonticon="more_vert" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="more_vert"></mat-icon><span class="mdc-button__label"></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" class="response-content ng-tns-c1330069915-283"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c636883080="" class="ng-tns-c636883080-285 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c636883080-285 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c636883080-285"><button _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c636883080-285 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c636883080-285"><span _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="ng-tns-c636883080-285">Show thinking</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c636883080-285"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c636883080-285 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c1226125435="" id="message-content-id-r_47b71a9547e04462" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1226125435="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_47b71a9547e04462" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这是一个非常经典且高级的 Spring 扩展场景。通过结合 <code>ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar</code> 和 <code>EnvironmentAware</code>，你可以实现一个**“只要在配置文件里写了配置，就自动生成对应 DataSource Bean”**的通用多数据源框架。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">这种方式比写死 <code>@Bean("ds1")</code>, <code>@Bean("ds2")</code> 要灵活得多。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">以下是完整的实现步骤和代码方案。</p><p data-path-to-node="3"></p><h3>核心思路</h3><p></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="4"><li><p data-path-to-node="4,0,0"><b>配置文件结构</b>：定义一种约定，例如 <code>custom.datasource.{name}.url</code>，其中 <code>{name}</code> 是动态的（如 master, slave）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,1,0"><b>Environment 读取</b>：使用 Spring Boot 的 <code>Binder</code> 工具（Spring Boot 2.0+），方便地将配置文件中 <code>custom.datasource</code> 下的所有属性读取为一个 <code>Map</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="4,2,0"><b>动态注册</b>：遍历这个 Map，为每一个数据源配置创建一个 <code>BeanDefinition</code>，并注册到容器中。</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="5"><p data-path-to-node="6"></p><h3>1. 准备工作：Maven 依赖</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="7">确保你的项目中引入了 Spring Boot Starter JDBC 和连接池（通常默认是 HikariCP）。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-308 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2179167942-308 ng-