83080="" class="ng-tns-c636883080-339 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c636883080-339 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c636883080-339"><button _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c636883080-339 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c636883080-339"><span _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="ng-tns-c636883080-339">Show thinking</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c636883080-339"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c636883080-339 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c1226125435="" id="message-content-id-r_bf5f6dd0a7142a3b" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1226125435="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_bf5f6dd0a7142a3b" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这是一个非常标准的**“读写分离”<b>或</b>“动态路由”**场景。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">要实现“默认使用主库，参数指定时切换从库”，你需要引入 Spring 的核心组件 <b><code>AbstractRoutingDataSource</code></b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">这个方案的架构如下：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><b>底层</b>：利用 <code>ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar</code> 注册所有真实的物理数据源（Master, Slave...）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><b>中间层</b>：注册一个 <b>路由数据源 (RoutingDataSource)</b>，并将其标记为 <code>@Primary</code>。所有的业务代码（Repository, Service）都只注入这个路由数据源。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,2,0"><b>上层</b>：提供一个 <code>ContextHolder</code>（基于 <code>ThreadLocal</code>），让你在代码里通过参数设置当前线程要用哪个数据源。</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="4"><p data-path-to-node="5"></p><h3>1. 准备工作：创建上下文持有者 (ContextHolder)</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="6">我们需要一个地方来存放“当前线程想用哪个数据源”的参数。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-352 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2179167942-352 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_bf5f6dd0a7142a3b&quot;,&quot;c_965ca52fee0e6f85&quot;,null,&quot;rc_d83968bdedd8bc15&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwj7hdrNx4WRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQjwQ" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2179167942-352 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-352">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2179167942-352 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2179167942-352 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_bf5f6dd0a7142a3b&quot;,&quot;c_965ca52fee0e6f85&quot;,null,&quot;rc_d83968bdedd8bc15&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2179167942-352"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2179167942-352"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-352"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2179167942-352"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">DataSourceContextHolder</span> </span>{
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 存放当前线程的数据源 Key</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">static</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">final</span> ThreadLocal&lt;String&gt; CONTEXT_HOLDER = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> ThreadLocal&lt;&gt;();

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 设置数据源 (例如: "slave")</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">static</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">setDataSourceType</span><span class="hljs-params">(String key)</span> </span>{
        CONTEXT_HOLDER.set(key);
    }

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 获取当前数据源</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">static</span> String <span class="hljs-title">getDataSourceType</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> </span>{
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> CONTEXT_HOLDER.get();
    }

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 清除，防止内存泄漏</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">static</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">clearDataSourceType</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> </span>{
        CONTEXT_HOLDER.remove();
    }
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="8"></p><h3>2. 定义路由数据源 (RoutingDataSource)</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="9">继承 Spring 原生的 <code>AbstractRoutingDataSource</code>，告诉它如何获取当前的 Key。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-353 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2179167942-353 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_bf5f6dd0a7142a3b&quot;,&quot;c_965ca52fee0e6f85&quot;,null,&quot;rc_d83968bdedd8bc15&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwj7hdrNx4WRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQkAQ" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2179167942-353 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-353">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2179167942-353 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2179167942-353 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_bf5f6dd0a7142a3b&quot;,&quot;c_965ca52fee0e6f85&quot;,null,&quot;rc_d83968bdedd8bc15&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2179167942-353"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2179167942-353"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-353"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2179167942-353"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.jdbc.datasource.lookup.AbstractRoutingDataSource;

<span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">DynamicRoutingDataSource</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">extends</span> <span class="hljs-title">AbstractRoutingDataSource</span> </span>{
    <span class="hljs-meta">@Override</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">protected</span> Object <span class="hljs-title">determineCurrentLookupKey</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> </span>{
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 从当前线程的 ThreadLocal 中拿 Key</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> DataSourceContextHolder.getDataSourceType();
    }
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="11"></p><h3>3. 核心：修改注册逻辑 (MultiDataSourceRegistrar)</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="12">这是最复杂也最关键的一步。我们需要在 <code>ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar</code> 中完成以下“骚操作”：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="13"><li><p data-path-to-node="13,0,0"><b>循环注册</b>所有的真实数据源 Bean（master, slave），但<b>不要</b>设为 Primary。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="13,1,0"><b>收集</b>这些 Bean 的引用（<code>RuntimeBeanReference</code>）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="13,2,0"><b>注册</b>一个 <code>DynamicRoutingDataSource</code> Bean：</p><ul data-path-to-node="13,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="13,2,1,0,0">把收集到的 Map 注入给它的 <code>targetDataSources</code> 属性。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="13,2,1,1,0">把标记为 <code>primary: true</code> 的那个数据源注入给它的 <code>defaultTargetDataSource</code> 属性。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="13,2,1,2,0">把这个路由数据源本身设为 <b><code>@Primary</code></b>。</p></li></ul></li></ol><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-354 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2179167942-354 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_bf5f6dd0a7142a3b&quot;,&quot;c_965ca52fee0e6f85&quot;,null,&quot;rc_d83968bdedd8bc15&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwj7hdrNx4WRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQkQQ" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2179167942-354 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-354">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2179167942-354 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2179167942-354 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_bf5f6dd0a7142a3b&quot;,&quot;c_965ca52fee0e6f85&quot;,null,&quot;rc_d83968bdedd8bc15&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2179167942-354"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2179167942-354"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-354"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2179167942-354"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> com.zaxxer.hikari.HikariDataSource;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.beans.factory.config.RuntimeBeanReference;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.beans.factory.support.BeanDefinitionBuilder;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.beans.factory.support.BeanDefinitionRegistry;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.beans.factory.support.ManagedMap;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.boot.context.properties.bind.BindResult;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.boot.context.properties.bind.Binder;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.context.EnvironmentAware;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.context.annotation.ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.core.env.Environment;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.core.type.AnnotationMetadata;

<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> java.util.Map;

<span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">MultiDataSourceRegistrar</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">implements</span> <span class="hljs-title">ImportBeanDefinitionRegistrar</span>, <span class="hljs-title">EnvironmentAware</span> </span>{

    <span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> Environment environment;

    <span class="hljs-meta">@Override</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">setEnvironment</span><span class="hljs-params">(Environment environment)</span> </span>{
        <span class="hljs-keyword">this</span>.environment = environment;
    }

    <span class="hljs-meta">@Override</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">registerBeanDefinitions</span><span class="hljs-params">(AnnotationMetadata importingClassMetadata, BeanDefinitionRegistry registry)</span> </span>{
        Binder binder = Binder.get(environment);
        BindResult&lt;Map&gt; bindResult = binder.bind(<span class="hljs-string">"custom.datasources"</span>, Map.class);

        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (!bindResult.isBound()) {
            <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span>;
        }

        Map&lt;String, Map&lt;String, Object&gt;&gt; dataSourcesConfig = bindResult.get();
        
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 准备一个 Map，用于存放给路由数据源的 &lt;Key, Bean引用&gt;</span>
        ManagedMap&lt;String, RuntimeBeanReference&gt; targetDataSources = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> ManagedMap&lt;&gt;();
        
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 记录默认数据源的 Bean 名称</span>
        String defaultDataSourceBeanName = <span class="hljs-keyword">null</span>;

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 3. 遍历并注册真实的物理数据源</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (Map.Entry&lt;String, Map&lt;String, Object&gt;&gt; entry : dataSourcesConfig.entrySet()) {
            String key = entry.getKey(); <span class="hljs-comment">// e.g., "master", "slave"</span>
            Map&lt;String, Object&gt; props = entry.getValue();
            
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 物理 Bean 的名字，例如 "ds_master"</span>
            String physicalBeanName = <span class="hljs-string">"ds_"</span> + key;

            <span class="hljs-comment">// A. 构建 HikariDataSource Bean</span>
            BeanDefinitionBuilder builder = BeanDefinitionBuilder.genericBeanDefinition(HikariDataSource.class);
            builder.addPropertyValue(<span class="hljs-string">"jdbcUrl"</span>, props.get(<span class="hljs-string">"url"</span>));
            builder.addPropertyValue(<span class="hljs-string">"username"</span>, props.get(<span class="hljs-string">"username"</span>));
            builder.addPropertyValue(<span class="hljs-string">"password"</span>, props.get(<span class="hljs-string">"password"</span>));
            builder.addPropertyValue(<span class="hljs-string">"driverClassName"</span>, props.get(<span class="hljs-string">"driver-class-name"</span>));
            
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 注意：物理数据源不再设置 setPrimary(true)</span>
            registry.registerBeanDefinition(physicalBeanName, builder.getBeanDefinition());

            <span class="hljs-comment">// B. 将这个 Bean 的引用加入 Map</span>
            <span class="hljs-comment">// RuntimeBeanReference 是关键，它代表指向容器中另一个 Bean 的指针</span>
            targetDataSources.put(key, <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> RuntimeBeanReference(physicalBeanName));

            <span class="hljs-comment">// C. 判断是否为默认数据源</span>
            Object primaryObj = props.get(<span class="hljs-string">"primary"</span>);
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 如果配置了 primary: true，或者名字叫 master，则视为默认</span>
            <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> ((primaryObj != <span class="hljs-keyword">null</span> &amp;&amp; Boolean.parseBoolean(primaryObj.toString())) || <span class="hljs-string">"master"</span>.equals(key)) {
                defaultDataSourceBeanName = physicalBeanName;
            }
        }

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 4. 注册最终的路由数据源 (DynamicRoutingDataSource)</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (defaultDataSourceBeanName != <span class="hljs-keyword">null</span>) {
            BeanDefinitionBuilder routerBuilder = BeanDefinitionBuilder.genericBeanDefinition(DynamicRoutingDataSource.class);
            
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 注入 targetDataSources (Map&lt;Object, Object&gt;)</span>
            routerBuilder.addPropertyValue(<span class="hljs-string">"targetDataSources"</span>, targetDataSources);
            
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 注入 defaultTargetDataSource (Object)，指向默认的物理 Bean</span>
            routerBuilder.addPropertyValue(<span class="hljs-string">"defaultTargetDataSource"</span>, <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> RuntimeBeanReference(defaultDataSourceBeanName));
            
            <span class="hljs-comment">// --- 关键：将路由数据源设为 Primary ---</span>
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 这样 @Autowired DataSource 注入的就是这个路由器</span>
            routerBuilder.setPrimary(<span class="hljs-keyword">true</span>);

            registry.registerBeanDefinition(<span class="hljs-string">"dataSource"</span>, routerBuilder.getBeanDefinition());
            
            System.out.println(<span class="hljs-string">"&gt;&gt;&gt; 多数据源初始化完成。默认数据源指向: "</span> + defaultDataSourceBeanName + <span class="hljs-string">"。路由 Bean 名为: dataSource"</span>);
        }
    }
}
